e\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.5mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"1,200 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"240 x 240 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:T998,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the Pixel Pitch of the IndoorFine 2.5mm display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The IndoorFine 2.5mm features a pixel pitch of 2.5mm, offering crisp and clear images ideal for indoor environments where close viewing distances are expected.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the IndoorFine 2.5mm display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This display delivers a brightness level of 1,200 nits, ensuring vibrant and easily visible content in indoor settings like lobbies and retail spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the IndoorFine 2.5mm be serviced from the front?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, the IndoorFine 2.5mm supports front-access serviceability, allowing for easy maintenance without needing to dismantle the entire installation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the power consumption of this LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"On average, the IndoorFine 2.5mm consumes around 280W per square meter, which is energy-efficient for high brightness indoor LED screens.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does IndoorFine 2.5mm compare to higher pixel pitch displays?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a 2.5mm pixel pitch, it offers finer image detail compared to displays with larger pitches like 3mm or above, making it better suited for close proximity viewing typical in professional interiors.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty is provided with the IndoorFine 2.5mm?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty that covers manufacturing defects and performance issues, ensuring peace of mind for your investment. Please contact us for specific warranty terms.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the IndoorFine 2.5mm suitable for use in retail environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Absolutely. Its high contrast ratio and brightness combined with sharp pixel pitch deliver engaging content in retail spaces, capturing customer attention effectively.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What certifications does this display carry?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The IndoorFine 2.5mm carries CE and UL certifications, ensuring it meets international standards for safety and quality.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"IndoorFine 2.5mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-ifp250\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type